# Colours come from Noctalia's zathura template, which rewrites
# ~/.config/zathura/noctaliarc on every wallpaper/palette change.
# Relative includes resolve against this file's directory - zathurarc(5).
include noctaliarc

# Recolouring is what makes PDFs render dark. noctaliarc supplies the
# recolor-lightcolor / recolor-darkcolor values but they only take effect
# when recolor is on, so it is off by default here - it inverts document
# colours, which can wreck figures and scanned pages.
# Toggle it per-document with Ctrl+R, or uncomment to make it the default:
# set recolor true
